(5425884, 780514, 30244, '<td valign="top">I think i would like it more if there was more colour in the sky.... but you can''t control the weather.<br/> <br/>nice model btw<br/> <br/>I would have maybe played around with increasing the saturation to bring out some colours<br/> <br/>8</td>', 'I think i would like it more if there was more colour in the sky.... but you can''t control the weather. nice model btw I would have maybe played around with increasing the saturation to bring out some colours 8', '2009-04-08 08:07:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5425886, 780286, 30244, '<td valign="top">great stock image<br/> <br/>8</td>', 'great stock image 8', '2009-04-08 08:08:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5425889, 780322, 101256, '<td valign="top">From a composition standpoint, this is a great setup - at first run through, I missed the point about no water and the model''s expressions - that''s pretty clever.  Unfortunately, the upper left light blooms and the general washed out colors from a soft focus don''t do the image any favors. The models are an intersting mix of hair style - a good effort.</td>', 'From a composition standpoint, this is a great setup - at first run through, I missed the point about no water and the model''s expressions - that''s pretty clever.  Unfortunately, the upper left light blooms and the general washed out colors from a soft focus don''t do the image any favors. The models are an intersting mix of hair style - a good effort.', '2009-04-08 08:10:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5425893, 780490, 101256, '<td valign="top">A standard format stock shot, but the DOF is awkward - this might have worked better with a fisheye lens to create a sense of dimension and evoke a positive feeling for the subject. I wonder if a backlit scene would have been better.  A good effort.</td>', 'A standard format stock shot, but the DOF is awkward - this might have worked better with a fisheye lens to create a sense of dimension and evoke a positive feeling for the subject. I wonder if a backlit scene would have been better.  A good effort.', '2009-04-08 08:13:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5425897, 780146, 30244, '<td valign="top">great image<br/>10</td>', 'great image10', '2009-04-08 08:14:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5425906, 780234, 101256, '<td valign="top">A good sound macro shot, but a marketing pro might take issue with the position of the ball and the rim of the racquet. It might have worked better as a vertical shot with the ball moving or closer to the sweet spot on the strings. A good effort.</td>', 'A good sound macro shot, but a marketing pro might take issue with the position of the ball and the rim of the racquet. It might have worked better as a vertical shot with the ball moving or closer to the sweet spot on the strings. A good effort.', '2009-04-08 08:18:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5425909, 780281, 30244, '<td valign="top">i think your ISO is too high.</td>', 'i think your ISO is too high.', '2009-04-08 08:20:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5425911, 779987, 101256, '<td valign="top">More movement that has purpose would have been better. A little higher shutter speed and tracking the action in the background with a little tighter shot would have helped this a lot.</td>', 'More movement that has purpose would have been better. A little higher shutter speed and tracking the action in the background with a little tighter shot would have helped this a lot.', '2009-04-08 08:21:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5425912, 780478, 30244, '<td valign="top">cool!  how did you do this?  zoom in while the shutter was open?</td>', 'cool!  how did you do this?  zoom in while the shutter was open?', '2009-04-08 08:21:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5425916, 780487, 101256, '<td valign="top">The author missed a great opportunity to evoke the serenity of doing yoga - with a little tighter crop at the top, a different angle on the model in which the model assumes a similar posture to the tree in the background (curved arm over the head similar to the branch with the lower arm matching the lower tree branch) it would have envoked a feeling of power and strength along with serenity and grace - all the things yoga is about. A good effort.</td>', 'The author missed a great opportunity to evoke the serenity of doing yoga - with a little tighter crop at the top, a different angle on the model in which the model assumes a similar posture to the tree in the background (curved arm over the head similar to the branch with the lower arm matching the lower tree branch) it would have envoked a feeling of power and strength along with serenity and grace - all the things yoga is about. A good effort.', '2009-04-08 08:25:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5425919, 779930, 101256, '<td valign="top">A good solid effort. The snow is a little washed out and lack detail, but the overall feeling of fun in the sun on a cold day is good. Solid effort.</td>', 'A good solid effort. The snow is a little washed out and lack detail, but the overall feeling of fun in the sun on a cold day is good. Solid effort.', '2009-04-08 08:26:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5425925, 779567, 101256, '<td valign="top">Walking away isn''t a good way to portray the fitness factor - you want smiling faces and happy places. DOF is problematic a little tighter on the subjects would have improved the image a lot without the foreground fade.</td>', 'Walking away isn''t a good way to portray the fitness factor - you want smiling faces and happy places. DOF is problematic a little tighter on the subjects would have improved the image a lot without the foreground fade.', '2009-04-08 08:29:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5425928, 780460, 101256, '<td valign="top">The author has done very well here conveying a sense of freedom and joy. This could have gone two ways either focusing on the dogs or the way the image is presented. Either would have worked well and this is the best so far.  A little awkward composition and a little faster shutter speed along with the excellant tracking that the author used would have made this perfect.</td>', 'The author has done very well here conveying a sense of freedom and joy. This could have gone two ways either focusing on the dogs or the way the image is presented. Either would have worked well and this is the best so far.  A little awkward composition and a little faster shutter speed along with the excellant tracking that the author used would have made this perfect.', '2009-04-08 08:32:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5425931, 780088, 101256, '<td valign="top">Very nice shadow shot - an excellant concept and good execution communicating a sense of purpose and strength.  Well done.</td>', 'Very nice shadow shot - an excellant concept and good execution communicating a sense of purpose and strength.  Well done.', '2009-04-08 08:34:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5425934, 779885, 101256, '<td valign="top">A terrific tracking shot connecting the sense of speed, time and space. And yes, race drivers are atheletes. Well done.</td>', 'A terrific tracking shot connecting the sense of speed, time and space. And yes, race drivers are atheletes. Well done.', '2009-04-08 08:36:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5425937, 780146, 101256, '<td valign="top">An otherwise excellant image marred by the awkward offset and blank background - the white space is begging for something to fill the void. Incredible detail although a little flaw in the eye reflection - you can see the photographer in the right eye of the subject (left as viewed). The eye thing is a general flaw with tight images and often missed. Overall a great effort.</td>', 'An otherwise excellant image marred by the awkward offset and blank background - the white space is begging for something to fill the void. Incredible detail although a little flaw in the eye reflection - you can see the photographer in the right eye of the subject (left as viewed). The eye thing is a general flaw with tight images and often missed. Overall a great effort.', '2009-04-08 08:38:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5425939, 780012, 101256, '<td valign="top">Excellant DOF control, nice and sharp presenting a good solid stock image. The model presents well with a sense of strength and purpose.  Well done.</td>', 'Excellant DOF control, nice and sharp presenting a good solid stock image. The model presents well with a sense of strength and purpose.  Well done.', '2009-04-08 08:39:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5425945, 780493, 101256, '<td valign="top">Good lord!! The anti-fitness shot - there are two ways to take this and the best way is to laugh as most obese men are actually pretty jolly people. A very out of the norm image - clever.</td>', 'Good lord!! The anti-fitness shot - there are two ways to take this and the best way is to laugh as most obese men are actually pretty jolly people. A very out of the norm image - clever.', '2009-04-08 08:43:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5425950, 779379, 101256, '<td valign="top">The author has outdone the rest of the field with this image - a perfect capture - strength, speed and power - terrific DOF control which gives a sense of detail without being a distraction to the subject. Rich in detail. A little minor flaw that''s not worth mentioning. Well done.</td>', 'The author has outdone the rest of the field with this image - a perfect capture - strength, speed and power - terrific DOF control which gives a sense of detail without being a distraction to the subject. Rich in detail. A little minor flaw that''s not worth mentioning. Well done.', '2009-04-08 08:46:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5425955, 780357, 101256, '<td valign="top">A good effort, but it would have helped to use a tracking technique to convey a sense of speed. A lack of detail in the snow is a negative. A difficult shot in difficult light.</td>', 'A good effort, but it would have helped to use a tracking technique to convey a sense of speed. A lack of detail in the snow is a negative. A difficult shot in difficult light.', '2009-04-08 08:50:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5425958, 780134, 101256, '<td valign="top">Over use of white space at the top of the image is a minor flaw and could have been cropped out giving the subject more impact. As it is, a good effort and a good composition.</td>', 'Over use of white space at the top of the image is a minor flaw and could have been cropped out giving the subject more impact. As it is, a good effort and a good composition.', '2009-04-08 08:51:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5425963, 780089, 101256, '<td valign="top">A great concept and composition - the DOF could be taken as a plus or minus depending on who is viewing the shot at any given time. It is amusing to see a fitness image showing critter slippers reclining which playing Wii tennis - very amusing.</td>', 'A great concept and composition - the DOF could be taken as a plus or minus depending on who is viewing the shot at any given time. It is amusing to see a fitness image showing critter slippers reclining which playing Wii tennis - very amusing.', '2009-04-08 08:54:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5425966, 780049, 101256, '<td valign="top">An excellant composition and capture. The black and white conversion works well, but could use a little more dynamic tonal range - it seems to be overly bland with no tension that one would expect from this type of image.</td>', 'An excellant composition and capture. The black and white conversion works well, but could use a little more dynamic tonal range - it seems to be overly bland with no tension that one would expect from this type of image.', '2009-04-08 08:55:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5425967, 780552, 101256, '<td valign="top">Communicates a sense of movement in a very static way - a difficult composition accomplished with skill. A little more light to build a clearer and sharper shadow would only have enhanced an already excellant effort.  Well done.</td>', 'Communicates a sense of movement in a very static way - a difficult composition accomplished with skill. A little more light to build a clearer and sharper shadow would only have enhanced an already excellant effort.  Well done.', '2009-04-08 08:57:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5425970, 780032, 101256, '<td valign="top">Very funny and very creative - the perfect "anti" fitness image. Nicely concieved and executed.</td>', 'Very funny and very creative - the perfect "anti" fitness image. Nicely concieved and executed.', '2009-04-08 08:58:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5425976, 779956, 101256, '<td valign="top">A great adaptation of "an apple a day" meme. Clear, crisp communicating how one accomplishes standard fitness. Great composition and execution of the central idea. Well done.</td>', 'A great adaptation of "an apple a day" meme. Clear, crisp communicating how one accomplishes standard fitness. Great composition and execution of the central idea. Well done.', '2009-04-08 08:59:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5425981, 780153, 101256, '<td valign="top">As an abstract concept, this works well with the title. It could work in any number of fitness venues as a motivational poster with different phrases. A very out of the ordinary way of looking at the challenge subject. Technically excellant with a minor flaw not worth mentioning. Well done.</td>', 'As an abstract concept, this works well with the title. It could work in any number of fitness venues as a motivational poster with different phrases. A very out of the ordinary way of looking at the challenge subject. Technically excellant with a minor flaw not worth mentioning. Well done.', '2009-04-08 09:02:13.000000', NULL, 1),
