(5425984, 780493, 51793, '<td valign="top">I don''t think this image has anything to do with the challenge. I am not voting on this image but if I did I would more than likely give it a 4 or lower. Reason being, I don''t think you met the challenge''s request to take an image of a stock photo of fitness. <br/> <br/>Other than that I would see a doctor about the marks on your stomach.</td>', 'I don''t think this image has anything to do with the challenge. I am not voting on this image but if I did I would more than likely give it a 4 or lower. Reason being, I don''t think you met the challenge''s request to take an image of a stock photo of fitness.  Other than that I would see a doctor about the marks on your stomach.', '2009-04-08 09:03:14.000000', NULL, 1),
