(5426037, 780286, 98141, '<td valign="top">This kind of reminds me of a modern Xena. It must be hard to work out with  nails like that. To be honest, I don''t really care for the bright light coming over her hand, to me it feels like it doesn''t belong in this pic: working out is gritty, tough and the light makes it feel dainty (so do the nails).</td>', 'This kind of reminds me of a modern Xena. It must be hard to work out with  nails like that. To be honest, I don''t really care for the bright light coming over her hand, to me it feels like it doesn''t belong in this pic: working out is gritty, tough and the light makes it feel dainty (so do the nails).', '2009-04-08 09:25:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5426039, 780514, 98141, '<td valign="top">I love yoga. This is a nicely composed shot, I like the way the reeds wrap around and fill in the frame a bit. Very peaceful.</td>', 'I love yoga. This is a nicely composed shot, I like the way the reeds wrap around and fill in the frame a bit. Very peaceful.', '2009-04-08 09:25:38.000000', NULL, 1),
