(5426047, 780145, 98141, '<td valign="top">This is a neat photo but it feels almost too dark/artistic to do well in stock... Then again, what do I know? Not much, actually. I do enjoy the lighting on this, just doesn''t feel "stock-ish" to me.</td>', 'This is a neat photo but it feels almost too dark/artistic to do well in stock... Then again, what do I know? Not much, actually. I do enjoy the lighting on this, just doesn''t feel "stock-ish" to me.', '2009-04-08 09:27:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5426050, 780146, 98141, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, perfect for this challenge, great, even lighting and interesting subject.</td>', 'Nice shot, perfect for this challenge, great, even lighting and interesting subject.', '2009-04-08 09:27:55.000000', NULL, 1),
