(5426117, 780519, 101256, '<td valign="top">Strong and purposeful imparting a sense of power and elegance. Exellant lighting control and the angle is very pleasing to the eye.</td>', 'Strong and purposeful imparting a sense of power and elegance. Exellant lighting control and the angle is very pleasing to the eye.', '2009-04-08 09:45:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5426121, 779568, 101256, '<td valign="top">Works very well as a youth fitness image and conveys a sense of simplicity and using what you have to stay fit. The photo could be a little sharper and the angle is awkward, but the capture was adequately composed.</td>', 'Works very well as a youth fitness image and conveys a sense of simplicity and using what you have to stay fit. The photo could be a little sharper and the angle is awkward, but the capture was adequately composed.', '2009-04-08 09:47:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5426125, 779958, 101702, '<td valign="top">Nice action shot. The helmet lower left is a distraction, but I realise with basic editing rules you could not do much about that really.</td>', 'Nice action shot. The helmet lower left is a distraction, but I realise with basic editing rules you could not do much about that really.', '2009-04-08 09:49:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5426126, 780309, 96534, '<td valign="top">ummm... can I have his phone number please? :-)</td>', 'ummm... can I have his phone number please? :-)', '2009-04-08 09:49:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5426129, 779923, 101256, '<td valign="top">The author chose a difficult angle which is a plus, but the image doesn''t particularly convey any sense of fitness. Certainly a good effort - it just doesn''t seem to have a purpose.</td>', 'The author chose a difficult angle which is a plus, but the image doesn''t particularly convey any sense of fitness. Certainly a good effort - it just doesn''t seem to have a purpose.', '2009-04-08 09:51:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5426132, 780474, 101256, '<td valign="top">Very amusing, unique and clever concept. All aspects of the image are excellant and well controlled. Good mix of B&amp;W and color - very imaginative. A top ten image.</td>', 'Very amusing, unique and clever concept. All aspects of the image are excellant and well controlled. Good mix of B&W and color - very imaginative. A top ten image.', '2009-04-08 09:53:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5426138, 780066, 101256, '<td valign="top">This could work well as a motivational poster image in a lot of ways. Conveys a sense of fun and purpose. It appears to be right on the edge of over sharpened. A solid effort.</td>', 'This could work well as a motivational poster image in a lot of ways. Conveys a sense of fun and purpose. It appears to be right on the edge of over sharpened. A solid effort.', '2009-04-08 09:54:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5426139, 780549, 98141, '<td valign="top">I think this would really pop more with a more shallow depth of field, the trees are a bit distracting.</td>', 'I think this would really pop more with a more shallow depth of field, the trees are a bit distracting.', '2009-04-08 09:55:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5426141, 780488, 98141, '<td valign="top">A lovely shot and perfect for this challenge. Simple, well-lit, and it could be used by anybody in the market for a fitness photo.</td>', 'A lovely shot and perfect for this challenge. Simple, well-lit, and it could be used by anybody in the market for a fitness photo.', '2009-04-08 09:56:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5426144, 779991, 101256, '<td valign="top">An good effort at a tracking capture imparting a sense of speed, grace and style. The subject would be a little clearer - a higher shutter speed would have helped a little along with a just a touch more movement in tracking. As it is, it stands well as a challenge entry.</td>', 'An good effort at a tracking capture imparting a sense of speed, grace and style. The subject would be a little clearer - a higher shutter speed would have helped a little along with a just a touch more movement in tracking. As it is, it stands well as a challenge entry.', '2009-04-08 09:56:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5426147, 779885, 98141, '<td valign="top">I''ve heard that driving in races like these are quite more physically taxing than people realize, but I still have to say that this doens''t really scream "fitness" to me. It is an interesting shot none-the-less.</td>', 'I''ve heard that driving in races like these are quite more physically taxing than people realize, but I still have to say that this doens''t really scream "fitness" to me. It is an interesting shot none-the-less.', '2009-04-08 09:57:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5426153, 780123, 98141, '<td valign="top">This pic is boring right now. I think it would have been more interesting to have a person actually doing the Wii Fit, like the person on the cover of the box.</td>', 'This pic is boring right now. I think it would have been more interesting to have a person actually doing the Wii Fit, like the person on the cover of the box.', '2009-04-08 09:58:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5426155, 780415, 101256, '<td valign="top">Very interesting that two images, very similar in concept, work much the same way in imparting a sense of healthy eating and regular exercise. Both images are very well done. A slight flaw with the lighting of the apple, but it does work and isn''t distracting. Well done.</td>', 'Very interesting that two images, very similar in concept, work much the same way in imparting a sense of healthy eating and regular exercise. Both images are very well done. A slight flaw with the lighting of the apple, but it does work and isn''t distracting. Well done.', '2009-04-08 09:58:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5426158, 780153, 98141, '<td valign="top">I think this would be more appropriate for a challenge called "Stock Photos: Time". It''s a nice pic, I love the high contrast, the shadows, but I really don''t think it meets the challenge theme, even with the title.</td>', 'I think this would be more appropriate for a challenge called "Stock Photos: Time". It''s a nice pic, I love the high contrast, the shadows, but I really don''t think it meets the challenge theme, even with the title.', '2009-04-08 09:59:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5426160, 779332, 101256, '<td valign="top">Another image that could be well used as a motivational poster in a gym or workout room. Crisp and sharp imparting a sense of power and health. Easily a top fifteen image.</td>', 'Another image that could be well used as a motivational poster in a gym or workout room. Crisp and sharp imparting a sense of power and health. Easily a top fifteen image.', '2009-04-08 10:00:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5426162, 780497, 98141, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot, I think I would have turned the ball so the brand name wasn''t right there if this were really going to a stock photography site, but I love the perspective on this and think it''s a job well done.</td>', 'Very nice shot, I think I would have turned the ball so the brand name wasn''t right there if this were really going to a stock photography site, but I love the perspective on this and think it''s a job well done.', '2009-04-08 10:00:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5426168, 780512, 98141, '<td valign="top">I think that in more even lighting and in color this would have more of a stock feel to it. Certainly meets the fitness bit of the challenge though.</td>', 'I think that in more even lighting and in color this would have more of a stock feel to it. Certainly meets the fitness bit of the challenge though.', '2009-04-08 10:01:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5426174, 780551, 98141, '<td valign="top">I wish the whole arrow were included in this shot, I think it feels a little decapitated. Cool idea for a shoot, though, fits the challenge really well.</td>', 'I wish the whole arrow were included in this shot, I think it feels a little decapitated. Cool idea for a shoot, though, fits the challenge really well.', '2009-04-08 10:03:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5426178, 780534, 98141, '<td valign="top">Now I''m going to have this song stuck in my head all day. Very interesting shot, I think this is a great idea for a stock photo.</td>', 'Now I''m going to have this song stuck in my head all day. Very interesting shot, I think this is a great idea for a stock photo.', '2009-04-08 10:03:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5426183, 780276, 98141, '<td valign="top">Fitness? Sure. Stock photo? No way. The background is very disstracting, the lighting is a bit harsh, I don''t care for the border... They''re adorable kids, but there''s a lack of attention to details in this snapshot.</td>', 'Fitness? Sure. Stock photo? No way. The background is very disstracting, the lighting is a bit harsh, I don''t care for the border... They''re adorable kids, but there''s a lack of attention to details in this snapshot.', '2009-04-08 10:05:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5426190, 780460, 98141, '<td valign="top">Dear God, that looks terrifying (and fun!). I think he should maybe have a helmet on or something. I think if the person in the background weren''t there I would like this a bit more, though I''m sur you had no control over that at the time! Fun shot.</td>', 'Dear God, that looks terrifying (and fun!). I think he should maybe have a helmet on or something. I think if the person in the background weren''t there I would like this a bit more, though I''m sur you had no control over that at the time! Fun shot.', '2009-04-08 10:07:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5426195, 780049, 98141, '<td valign="top">Lighting is a bit harsh and the background is distracting and busy. Shallow DOF would make this pop more and I think it would look good in color.</td>', 'Lighting is a bit harsh and the background is distracting and busy. Shallow DOF would make this pop more and I think it would look good in color.', '2009-04-08 10:08:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5426201, 780109, 98141, '<td valign="top">This loaded really small, fyi, and that never does much to help a person''s score. That said, I do like this pic, it''s nice how the light path contrasts with her dark clothes.</td>', 'This loaded really small, fyi, and that never does much to help a person''s score. That said, I do like this pic, it''s nice how the light path contrasts with her dark clothes.', '2009-04-08 10:09:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5426203, 780557, 98141, '<td valign="top">Nice selective desat, though I think for stock photography it might be nice to have it in color. Not that I know much about it. Great lighting, very even and soft.</td>', 'Nice selective desat, though I think for stock photography it might be nice to have it in color. Not that I know much about it. Great lighting, very even and soft.', '2009-04-08 10:10:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5426213, 780089, 98141, '<td valign="top">I like the idea for this photo, just not so much the execution. The background behind the remote is very distracting, there''s a bit of glare right above the remote, and the way the frame cuts off the hand and feet right at the joints gives the person an incomplete feel imho.</td>', 'I like the idea for this photo, just not so much the execution. The background behind the remote is very distracting, there''s a bit of glare right above the remote, and the way the frame cuts off the hand and feet right at the joints gives the person an incomplete feel imho.', '2009-04-08 10:13:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5426214, 780557, 43774, '<td valign="top">I like the photo other than the purple tinged arm. To me a purple or blue skin tone would mean death or sickness, not fitness. Not sure why you went with selective desaturation when a natural looking skin could would have been fine.</td>', 'I like the photo other than the purple tinged arm. To me a purple or blue skin tone would mean death or sickness, not fitness. Not sure why you went with selective desaturation when a natural looking skin could would have been fine.', '2009-04-08 10:13:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5426222, 780373, 98141, '<td valign="top">Very interesting shot. I think this model has too much personality for it to feel like a stock photo. Lighting is moody and great, though I do think I''d like it better without the bright light in the upper right. Smoke is a cool effect.</td>', 'Very interesting shot. I think this model has too much personality for it to feel like a stock photo. Lighting is moody and great, though I do think I''d like it better without the bright light in the upper right. Smoke is a cool effect.', '2009-04-08 10:14:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5426225, 780519, 98141, '<td valign="top">I don''t feel like this is inclusive enough. It''s not really close enough to be a neat abstract macro, but it''s not far away enough to really be a good product shot.</td>', 'I don''t feel like this is inclusive enough. It''s not really close enough to be a neat abstract macro, but it''s not far away enough to really be a good product shot.', '2009-04-08 10:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5426234, 779987, 98141, '<td valign="top">The subjects can move, but you should hold your camera still - this is really blurry (even the grass and non-moving objects). The hedges really draw attention to the horizon being tilted. The girls'' feet not being in the picture feels strange.</td>', 'The subjects can move, but you should hold your camera still - this is really blurry (even the grass and non-moving objects). The hedges really draw attention to the horizon being tilted. The girls'' feet not being in the picture feels strange.', '2009-04-08 10:18:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5426245, 780390, 98141, '<td valign="top">They all have such chubby little cheeks, they''re so adorable. The people in the background are distracting, try a shallower depth of field to blur them out. Also, in stock photography it''s my understanding that you would need release forms for allll of them from their parents, what a pain that would be ;) I think it''s too much of a snapshot to do well in a stock photography challenge, but it sure is cute.</td>', 'They all have such chubby little cheeks, they''re so adorable. The people in the background are distracting, try a shallower depth of field to blur them out. Also, in stock photography it''s my understanding that you would need release forms for allll of them from their parents, what a pain that would be ;) I think it''s too much of a snapshot to do well in a stock photography challenge, but it sure is cute.', '2009-04-08 10:22:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5426247, 779338, 98141, '<td valign="top">Great shot! What a moment to capture. I love the dirt flying up in the air. Great use of focus and DOF. Love the framing between the legs like that.</td>', 'Great shot! What a moment to capture. I love the dirt flying up in the air. Great use of focus and DOF. Love the framing between the legs like that.', '2009-04-08 10:22:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5426252, 780493, 98141, '<td valign="top">The angle of this combined with the harsh shadows on the wall behind him and the black and white gives it a bit of a somber look that kind of makes me feel like this is a shot of a person on a morgue table, laying down instead of standing. This falls really flat to me.</td>', 'The angle of this combined with the harsh shadows on the wall behind him and the black and white gives it a bit of a somber look that kind of makes me feel like this is a shot of a person on a morgue table, laying down instead of standing. This falls really flat to me.', '2009-04-08 10:25:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5426255, 778855, 98141, '<td valign="top">I think I have that measuring tape in blue. The lighting might be a little too high key for the white product, the front one feels a little overblown.</td>', 'I think I have that measuring tape in blue. The lighting might be a little too high key for the white product, the front one feels a little overblown.', '2009-04-08 10:26:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5426261, 780489, 98141, '<td valign="top">Great shot, I would have turned the candy and chips over so that the brand names couldn''t be seen for a stock photo, but I think this is really clever and well shot.</td>', 'Great shot, I would have turned the candy and chips over so that the brand names couldn''t be seen for a stock photo, but I think this is really clever and well shot.', '2009-04-08 10:27:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5426264, 780134, 98141, '<td valign="top">Hmmm, I don''t think this would speak to fitness if not for the title. I like high-key lighting, but the edges of this just disappear and I think it might be a little too strong in this shot.</td>', 'Hmmm, I don''t think this would speak to fitness if not for the title. I like high-key lighting, but the edges of this just disappear and I think it might be a little too strong in this shot.', '2009-04-08 10:28:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5426269, 779923, 98141, '<td valign="top">I think I''d like this better if you rotated it to be a vertical shot... the tilt doesn''t feel too extreme that way. Nothing seems sharp/in focus.</td>', 'I think I''d like this better if you rotated it to be a vertical shot... the tilt doesn''t feel too extreme that way. Nothing seems sharp/in focus.', '2009-04-08 10:30:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5426349, 779885, 61961, '<td valign="top">You know, this is a lovely, colorful, sharp action shot, but it''s in the wrong challenge (despite the caption).  I also like the visual impact of the horizontal line dividing road and grass -- cool if it is the edge of the road, but more likely it is a border dividing the frame and therefore probably illegal, I''m sorry to say.</td>', 'You know, this is a lovely, colorful, sharp action shot, but it''s in the wrong challenge (despite the caption).  I also like the visual impact of the horizontal line dividing road and grass -- cool if it is the edge of the road, but more likely it is a border dividing the frame and therefore probably illegal, I''m sorry to say.', '2009-04-08 10:51:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5426396, 780373, 3102, '<td valign="top">Clearly a ribbon-worthy entry!</td>', 'Clearly a ribbon-worthy entry!', '2009-04-08 11:05:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5426397, 780069, 3102, '<td valign="top">I''ll be surprised if this isn''t a ribbon-winner.  Nicely done!</td>', 'I''ll be surprised if this isn''t a ribbon-winner.  Nicely done!', '2009-04-08 11:05:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5426541, 780123, 101256, '<td valign="top">A good concept and good composition slightly flawed by imperfect focus. The odd color cast does not help the image along with the appearance of being slightly oversharpened. A good basic effort though.</td>', 'A good concept and good composition slightly flawed by imperfect focus. The odd color cast does not help the image along with the appearance of being slightly oversharpened. A good basic effort though.', '2009-04-08 11:52:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5426565, 780551, 101256, '<td valign="top">The image has a cut out appearance and would have been much better with some type of definitive background. While the title suggests the subject, the image is more oriented towards the archer and glasses rather than the bow sight. It might have been better to take the image from the front of the bow and emphasize the bow sight using a DOF fade. As a fitness image, it doesn''t quite work.</td>', 'The image has a cut out appearance and would have been much better with some type of definitive background. While the title suggests the subject, the image is more oriented towards the archer and glasses rather than the bow sight. It might have been better to take the image from the front of the bow and emphasize the bow sight using a DOF fade. As a fitness image, it doesn''t quite work.', '2009-04-08 11:57:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5426582, 780557, 101256, '<td valign="top">Over sharpened feel of the image does not to it any favors. The blank background is not a good choice. A clever use of slight violet shade on the arm  with the blue hand weight, but the hand fades into the background and the arm does not have a lot of definition. A good effort and concept just a little lacking in execution.</td>', 'Over sharpened feel of the image does not to it any favors. The blank background is not a good choice. A clever use of slight violet shade on the arm  with the blue hand weight, but the hand fades into the background and the arm does not have a lot of definition. A good effort and concept just a little lacking in execution.', '2009-04-08 12:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5426592, 780549, 101256, '<td valign="top">A touch more centered would have made this an excellant demonstration of stop motion action. A beautiful capture which could have gone very wrong. Good detail - little more contrast to bring out the rear wheel would be a major plus as it tends to blend into the darker background of the tree line. The little details make this a great image and evocative of fitness of the motocross athelete. A top fifteen image at least if not top ten.</td>', 'A touch more centered would have made this an excellant demonstration of stop motion action. A beautiful capture which could have gone very wrong. Good detail - little more contrast to bring out the rear wheel would be a major plus as it tends to blend into the darker background of the tree line. The little details make this a great image and evocative of fitness of the motocross athelete. A top fifteen image at least if not top ten.', '2009-04-08 12:04:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5426602, 779098, 101256, '<td valign="top">The apple a day is now the most common image type posted in this challenge and as the other two, does exactly what it''s meant to do. The slight DOF change is perfect - a minor complaint about the light bloom on the apple, but it''s not over whelming - different from the other submissions indicating a different way of looking at the subject. Precision in the detail make it stand out a little more than the others. Well done.</td>', 'The apple a day is now the most common image type posted in this challenge and as the other two, does exactly what it''s meant to do. The slight DOF change is perfect - a minor complaint about the light bloom on the apple, but it''s not over whelming - different from the other submissions indicating a different way of looking at the subject. Precision in the detail make it stand out a little more than the others. Well done.', '2009-04-08 12:07:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5426607, 779679, 101256, '<td valign="top">Excellant tone and quality slightly affected by the overly darkened subject. However it does work as demonstration of body fitness and from a technical standpoint is perfect. A little lighter subject would be a huge plus. As it stands a top fifteen image for sure - possibly a ribbon winner.</td>', 'Excellant tone and quality slightly affected by the overly darkened subject. However it does work as demonstration of body fitness and from a technical standpoint is perfect. A little lighter subject would be a huge plus. As it stands a top fifteen image for sure - possibly a ribbon winner.', '2009-04-08 12:09:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5426614, 779061, 69192, '<td valign="top">Seems a little blown out on the left.  Creative idea though!</td>', 'Seems a little blown out on the left.  Creative idea though!', '2009-04-08 12:10:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5426618, 780278, 101256, '<td valign="top">A terrific capture demonstrating the nature of fitness. Good detail although it appears to be just slightly soft in focus but this does not impact the subject negatively. Excellant DOF control giving a sense of detail without being over whelming. A top fifteen image for sure - possibly a top ten.</td>', 'A terrific capture demonstrating the nature of fitness. Good detail although it appears to be just slightly soft in focus but this does not impact the subject negatively. Excellant DOF control giving a sense of detail without being over whelming. A top fifteen image for sure - possibly a top ten.', '2009-04-08 12:11:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5426624, 780489, 69192, '<td valign="top">Great idea for the challenge!  Great lighting!</td>', 'Great idea for the challenge!  Great lighting!', '2009-04-08 12:12:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5426632, 780373, 69192, '<td valign="top">Very nice!  I really like the light in the back.</td>', 'Very nice!  I really like the light in the back.', '2009-04-08 12:14:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5426636, 780512, 69192, '<td valign="top">The reddish tint of color on the right side just above his shoulder is a little distracting.  Interesting lighting though.</td>', 'The reddish tint of color on the right side just above his shoulder is a little distracting.  Interesting lighting though.', '2009-04-08 12:15:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5426652, 780343, 101256, '<td valign="top">A very clever and imaginative use of framing - creative causing the viewer to pause and take a closer look to determine what the author has done. Good use of grain to give a sense of texture and depth. A good representation of the old time, free weight power gym or boxing camp. Very representative of the grit and grime of staying fit. Comparitively speaking, this is a very unique image compared to the rest of the submissions and clearly out side the norm. Well done.</td>', 'A very clever and imaginative use of framing - creative causing the viewer to pause and take a closer look to determine what the author has done. Good use of grain to give a sense of texture and depth. A good representation of the old time, free weight power gym or boxing camp. Very representative of the grit and grime of staying fit. Comparitively speaking, this is a very unique image compared to the rest of the submissions and clearly out side the norm. Well done.', '2009-04-08 12:20:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5426660, 780309, 69192, '<td valign="top">The jeans seem out of place.</td>', 'The jeans seem out of place.', '2009-04-08 12:22:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5426663, 780286, 101256, '<td valign="top">A good composition flawed by the odd lighting and highlights plus the extraneous green above the weight and the red speck on the fingernail.  The  white appears to be ever so over done which draws the eye away from the model. Excellant detail and with different lighting or a softer lighting, would have been a top contender.</td>', 'A good composition flawed by the odd lighting and highlights plus the extraneous green above the weight and the red speck on the fingernail.  The  white appears to be ever so over done which draws the eye away from the model. Excellant detail and with different lighting or a softer lighting, would have been a top contender.', '2009-04-08 12:22:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5426664, 780343, 69192, '<td valign="top">The border is really distracting.</td>', 'The border is really distracting.', '2009-04-08 12:23:01.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(5426666, 780514, 69192, '<td valign="top">A tighter crop on the girl with the mountains slightly out of focus might be more interesting.</td>', 'A tighter crop on the girl with the mountains slightly out of focus might be more interesting.', '2009-04-08 12:24:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5426669, 780489, 101256, '<td valign="top">Very whimsical and highly amusing.  A very good choice for a motivational poster for a weight loss clinic. Clever use of the toes to hide the weight display.  The background is a little stark, but the choice is well understood and isn''t a major flaw. Excellant use of color and positioning of the props. Should be a top ten just for the clever mix of humor and intent.</td>', 'Very whimsical and highly amusing.  A very good choice for a motivational poster for a weight loss clinic. Clever use of the toes to hide the weight display.  The background is a little stark, but the choice is well understood and isn''t a major flaw. Excellant use of color and positioning of the props. Should be a top ten just for the clever mix of humor and intent.', '2009-04-08 12:25:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5426671, 780322, 69192, '<td valign="top">This looks like an album cover.  Creative.</td>', 'This looks like an album cover.  Creative.', '2009-04-08 12:25:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5426675, 780534, 69192, '<td valign="top">The shadow in the back is a little distracting.  Creative idea though!</td>', 'The shadow in the back is a little distracting.  Creative idea though!', '2009-04-08 12:27:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5426679, 780032, 69192, '<td valign="top">Creative idea!</td>', 'Creative idea!', '2009-04-08 12:29:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5426687, 780497, 101256, '<td valign="top">A solid effort and as a statement of fitness, works on a couple of levels. The use of DOF is different and it might have been better to focus on a sharper foreground with a gentle fade into the dark background the author''s choice is perfectly understandable.</td>', 'A solid effort and as a statement of fitness, works on a couple of levels. The use of DOF is different and it might have been better to focus on a sharper foreground with a gentle fade into the dark background the author''s choice is perfectly understandable.', '2009-04-08 12:31:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5426699, 778855, 101256, '<td valign="top">An interesting and different approach to weight loss and fitness the image works very well. Good solid composition and good detail. The slight DOF change from right to left is intriguing, but it might have been a better choice to keep the entire image in sharp relief.</td>', 'An interesting and different approach to weight loss and fitness the image works very well. Good solid composition and good detail. The slight DOF change from right to left is intriguing, but it might have been a better choice to keep the entire image in sharp relief.', '2009-04-08 12:34:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5426710, 780373, 15832, '<td valign="top">I can sense larus absence here;)   Whoever took this picture though i am just gonna say this.    Congrats for the Blue ribbon...</td>', 'I can sense larus absence here;)   Whoever took this picture though i am just gonna say this.    Congrats for the Blue ribbon...', '2009-04-08 12:36:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5426715, 779603, 101256, '<td valign="top">The slight saturation,excellent detail and overall emotional impact are stellar. The soft relief foreground leading to the incredibly sharp subject is masterful. Very effective use of space to impart a feeling of intensity on the part of the subjects. A sure fire ribbon winner.</td>', 'The slight saturation,excellent detail and overall emotional impact are stellar. The soft relief foreground leading to the incredibly sharp subject is masterful. Very effective use of space to impart a feeling of intensity on the part of the subjects. A sure fire ribbon winner.', '2009-04-08 12:37:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5426731, 780090, 101256, '<td valign="top">Go at your own pace and do your own thing is the sense of the image perfectly presented to the viewer. Unfortunately, the gray in the foreground creates a sense of false framing and intensifies the sense that the image is tilted which it isn''t - the whimsical nature of the image is hurt by this unfortunate circumstance.  A good solid effort with a different messge that is very effective.</td>', 'Go at your own pace and do your own thing is the sense of the image perfectly presented to the viewer. Unfortunately, the gray in the foreground creates a sense of false framing and intensifies the sense that the image is tilted which it isn''t - the whimsical nature of the image is hurt by this unfortunate circumstance.  A good solid effort with a different messge that is very effective.', '2009-04-08 12:41:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5426749, 780427, 101256, '<td valign="top">A terrific title and a terrific photograph. The feeling is one of lonely comtemplation in the face of potential danger. The incredible detail is shocking. A certain ribbon candidate and a for sure top ten image.</td>', 'A terrific title and a terrific photograph. The feeling is one of lonely comtemplation in the face of potential danger. The incredible detail is shocking. A certain ribbon candidate and a for sure top ten image.', '2009-04-08 12:44:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5426757, 779338, 101256, '<td valign="top">Another effective use of limited focus to achieve a provacative effect. A great demonstration of intent and purpose with rich detail and soft detail. The author clearly created an iconic image of the great sport of baseball. Well done.</td>', 'Another effective use of limited focus to achieve a provacative effect. A great demonstration of intent and purpose with rich detail and soft detail. The author clearly created an iconic image of the great sport of baseball. Well done.', '2009-04-08 12:46:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5426760, 779491, 101256, '<td valign="top">Clever title and a very clever use of footwear. Some images and titles don''t work, but the overall impact of this is stellar. A ribbon contender for sure.</td>', 'Clever title and a very clever use of footwear. Some images and titles don''t work, but the overall impact of this is stellar. A ribbon contender for sure.', '2009-04-08 12:47:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5426768, 780389, 101256, '<td valign="top">The soft focus doesn''t help the image and the slight reflection is distracting. On the plus side, the single subject makes the point very effectively - it''s jut a little short on execution.  A sharper image sans the reflection would have made this a top image in the challenge.</td>', 'The soft focus doesn''t help the image and the slight reflection is distracting. On the plus side, the single subject makes the point very effectively - it''s jut a little short on execution.  A sharper image sans the reflection would have made this a top image in the challenge.', '2009-04-08 12:49:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5426780, 780203, 101256, '<td valign="top">Very free form showing great joy and fitness - a good demonstraction. The subject could be a little darker given the stark white background. The neck and chin of the dancer fade into the background - a subtle difference in background color would have enhanced this image to near perfect if a darker and more contrasty subject was used. A solid effort.</td>', 'Very free form showing great joy and fitness - a good demonstraction. The subject could be a little darker given the stark white background. The neck and chin of the dancer fade into the background - a subtle difference in background color would have enhanced this image to near perfect if a darker and more contrasty subject was used. A solid effort.', '2009-04-08 12:52:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5426785, 780508, 101256, '<td valign="top">Wow factor five, the slight abstract form around the sole of the shoe works very well. The slight grain to the background works well against the precision detail of the shoe and sock. A very good effort.</td>', 'Wow factor five, the slight abstract form around the sole of the shoe works very well. The slight grain to the background works well against the precision detail of the shoe and sock. A very good effort.', '2009-04-08 12:53:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5426789, 779748, 101256, '<td valign="top">The very subtle DOF fade is very clever and a good way to concentrate the viewer''s eye on head and shoulders which is the purpose of pushups. The image works in a number of different ways. Another plus is the nature of the sharp angle of the arms which compliment the straight body with gentle curves. A terrific composition well executed.</td>', 'The very subtle DOF fade is very clever and a good way to concentrate the viewer''s eye on head and shoulders which is the purpose of pushups. The image works in a number of different ways. Another plus is the nature of the sharp angle of the arms which compliment the straight body with gentle curves. A terrific composition well executed.', '2009-04-08 12:56:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5426795, 778924, 101256, '<td valign="top">Free weights - why weight? Excellant!! Richly detailed with the soft fade to the complimentary background the image evokes a sense of what it takes to stay trim and fit.  A top ten image and a ribbon contender.</td>', 'Free weights - why weight? Excellant!! Richly detailed with the soft fade to the complimentary background the image evokes a sense of what it takes to stay trim and fit.  A top ten image and a ribbon contender.', '2009-04-08 12:58:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5426802, 780488, 101256, '<td valign="top">Another provoking image with a little minor flaw in that the bottom weight edge fades and joins the background, but that is so picky, it shouldn''t even be mentioned. Rich detail and excellant DOF control. A solid effort at demonstrating the tools of fitness.  Well done.</td>', 'Another provoking image with a little minor flaw in that the bottom weight edge fades and joins the background, but that is so picky, it shouldn''t even be mentioned. Rich detail and excellant DOF control. A solid effort at demonstrating the tools of fitness.  Well done.', '2009-04-08 12:59:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5426819, 779097, 101256, '<td valign="top">Clever use of saturation to create a sense of false negative. Rich details without being overbearing. Soft background providing some detail without being over whelming. A solid effort in producing an image with respect to fitness.</td>', 'Clever use of saturation to create a sense of false negative. Rich details without being overbearing. Soft background providing some detail without being over whelming. A solid effort in producing an image with respect to fitness.', '2009-04-08 13:04:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5426834, 779061, 101256, '<td valign="top">Clever and unique way to demonstrate how to stay fit with the tools at hand. This would make a great motivational poster for any number of concepts. Solid detail with a subtle touch with the chair back fade. The focus could be just a touch sharper, but it''s fine as it is. Well done.</td>', 'Clever and unique way to demonstrate how to stay fit with the tools at hand. This would make a great motivational poster for any number of concepts. Solid detail with a subtle touch with the chair back fade. The focus could be just a touch sharper, but it''s fine as it is. Well done.', '2009-04-08 13:08:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5426842, 780419, 101256, '<td valign="top">Another great choice for a motivational poster.  The image is a little too long and could be cropped at the bottom without affecting the overall impact on the subject and that type of crop would present the subject more favorably and concentrate the viewer on the subject''s efforts to get to that position. A solid effort.</td>', 'Another great choice for a motivational poster.  The image is a little too long and could be cropped at the bottom without affecting the overall impact on the subject and that type of crop would present the subject more favorably and concentrate the viewer on the subject''s efforts to get to that position. A solid effort.', '2009-04-08 13:10:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5426847, 780550, 101256, '<td valign="top">Laugh out loud funny - very clever and unique - similar in concept to an earlier image and equally effective, but the different treatment is much simpler imparting the same concept in much simpler form. The green color is a nice touch. Should be a top ten image and a potential ribbon winner.</td>', 'Laugh out loud funny - very clever and unique - similar in concept to an earlier image and equally effective, but the different treatment is much simpler imparting the same concept in much simpler form. The green color is a nice touch. Should be a top ten image and a potential ribbon winner.', '2009-04-08 13:12:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5426851, 780518, 101256, '<td valign="top">The white space at the top could be cropped makeing the presentation much more effective. Rich detail and evokes a sense of well being and health. Not a ribbon contender, but certainly a top ten image.</td>', 'The white space at the top could be cropped makeing the presentation much more effective. Rich detail and evokes a sense of well being and health. Not a ribbon contender, but certainly a top ten image.', '2009-04-08 13:13:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5426861, 780478, 101256, '<td valign="top">Very unigue presentation - the motion blur in combination with subtle DOF changes compliment the sharper subject. The intensity of this image is very complimentary to the title and as a whole works well. A solid effort to demonstrate fitness.</td>', 'Very unigue presentation - the motion blur in combination with subtle DOF changes compliment the sharper subject. The intensity of this image is very complimentary to the title and as a whole works well. A solid effort to demonstrate fitness.', '2009-04-08 13:16:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5426868, 779724, 101256, '<td valign="top">The way the author handled the DOF fade is excellant. Demonstrates the sport well and as a good way to keep active and fit. The spacing of the balls and the way they are presented at different angles is very effective.  A good solid effort as demonstrating the fitness subject challenge.</td>', 'The way the author handled the DOF fade is excellant. Demonstrates the sport well and as a good way to keep active and fit. The spacing of the balls and the way they are presented at different angles is very effective.  A good solid effort as demonstrating the fitness subject challenge.', '2009-04-08 13:19:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5427003, 780419, 98141, '<td valign="top">Wow, what a cool sport and a cool shot. I love the narrowness of the frame.</td>', 'Wow, what a cool sport and a cool shot. I love the narrowness of the frame.', '2009-04-08 14:15:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5427008, 779332, 48926, '<td valign="top">Not that you can control the sun or anything, but I would have liked it better if the sun was illuminating his back so all the muscles would stand out more.</td>', 'Not that you can control the sun or anything, but I would have liked it better if the sun was illuminating his back so all the muscles would stand out more.', '2009-04-08 14:16:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5427010, 780090, 98141, '<td valign="top">This is kind of wacky and fun. Not sure that it really represents the idea of "stock" well, but the pose and the clothes certainly demonstrate fitness.</td>', 'This is kind of wacky and fun. Not sure that it really represents the idea of "stock" well, but the pose and the clothes certainly demonstrate fitness.', '2009-04-08 14:16:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5427019, 780518, 98141, '<td valign="top">I think if this were a mother and child instead of siblings it would work better. Something like "Keeping fit with Baby!" It''s a nice portrait, though the white balance seems a bit off to me. Also, the line going from her wrist to the edge is very distracting and I wish her whole foot were in the shot.</td>', 'I think if this were a mother and child instead of siblings it would work better. Something like "Keeping fit with Baby!" It''s a nice portrait, though the white balance seems a bit off to me. Also, the line going from her wrist to the edge is very distracting and I wish her whole foot were in the shot.', '2009-04-08 14:19:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5427020, 780012, 98141, '<td valign="top">It''s a great pose and I think the angle works well, but I think she needs more diffused light on her face. The light on her arm looks great but her facial features are shadowy.</td>', 'It''s a great pose and I think the angle works well, but I think she needs more diffused light on her face. The light on her arm looks great but her facial features are shadowy.', '2009-04-08 14:19:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5427023, 780487, 98141, '<td valign="top">I like the idea of doing yoga in nature. But this nature is very distracting. I think a shallower DOF would do wonders to help focus this pic on your subject.</td>', 'I like the idea of doing yoga in nature. But this nature is very distracting. I think a shallower DOF would do wonders to help focus this pic on your subject.', '2009-04-08 14:19:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5427028, 779679, 98141, '<td valign="top">Very interesting lighting. I think high-key feels more stock-ish, but that''s just me as I don''t have very much experience with that sort of thing. This is a really fun photo in either case.</td>', 'Very interesting lighting. I think high-key feels more stock-ish, but that''s just me as I don''t have very much experience with that sort of thing. This is a really fun photo in either case.', '2009-04-08 14:21:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5427033, 780490, 98141, '<td valign="top">I think a lower angle would add a lot of depth to this, right now it falls a little flat for me. All the glare off the water bottle makes it feel like a snapshot to me as well.</td>', 'I think a lower angle would add a lot of depth to this, right now it falls a little flat for me. All the glare off the water bottle makes it feel like a snapshot to me as well.', '2009-04-08 14:22:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5427044, 780343, 98141, '<td valign="top">I''m curious how you did this in Basic Editing. This is not very much like a stock photo, imho, as agencies looking for stock would probably want to do their own borders and such. I like the angle of the shot.</td>', 'I''m curious how you did this in Basic Editing. This is not very much like a stock photo, imho, as agencies looking for stock would probably want to do their own borders and such. I like the angle of the shot.', '2009-04-08 14:24:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5427045, 780550, 48926, '<td valign="top">I love this!  So funny.</td>', 'I love this!  So funny.', '2009-04-08 14:25:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5427046, 780552, 98141, '<td valign="top">She''s jumping rope awfully close to that wall ;) I think the pose is great, but it''s too obvious that she''s not actually jumping rope.</td>', 'She''s jumping rope awfully close to that wall ;) I think the pose is great, but it''s too obvious that she''s not actually jumping rope.', '2009-04-08 14:26:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5427049, 779603, 98141, '<td valign="top">I think it''s an interesting photo, but not for stock. A shallower DOF would be nice, the people (especially the man in the white shirt) in the background are distracting.</td>', 'I think it''s an interesting photo, but not for stock. A shallower DOF would be nice, the people (especially the man in the white shirt) in the background are distracting.', '2009-04-08 14:27:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5427059, 779061, 98141, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure why there is such a hot spot right behind his bum, but it looks strange to me. Also, cutting his foot off right at the ankle like that appears weird to me. I like the idea of this shot though, it''s clever.</td>', 'I''m not sure why there is such a hot spot right behind his bum, but it looks strange to me. Also, cutting his foot off right at the ankle like that appears weird to me. I like the idea of this shot though, it''s clever.', '2009-04-08 14:31:21.000000', NULL, 1),
