(5427065, 780389, 98141, '<td valign="top">This does not seem in focus to me. Also, what does an apple have to do with fitness? Healthy eating, sure, but fitness? I don''t think this represents it well.</td>', 'This does not seem in focus to me. Also, what does an apple have to do with fitness? Healthy eating, sure, but fitness? I don''t think this represents it well.', '2009-04-08 14:34:14.000000', NULL, 1),
