(5427402, 780195, 101256, '<td valign="top">The author could almost have called this "walk of fire" and it would have worked well. The sky is very interesting and the cloud formation is intriguing.  It meets the expectations of fitness and could well be a motivational poster with many meanings available for fitness.  A good effort nicely concieved.</td>', 'The author could almost have called this "walk of fire" and it would have worked well. The sky is very interesting and the cloud formation is intriguing.  It meets the expectations of fitness and could well be a motivational poster with many meanings available for fitness.  A good effort nicely concieved.', '2009-04-08 18:29:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5427405, 780512, 101256, '<td valign="top">The lighting is a little strange and the image seems to have a rather odd color cast in the nose. There is also a hot pixel right above the tip of the nose that is very distracting in addition to the odd reflection in the glasses. The deep shadow would have been better utilized if there was more fade instead of a sharp division.</td>', 'The lighting is a little strange and the image seems to have a rather odd color cast in the nose. There is also a hot pixel right above the tip of the nose that is very distracting in addition to the odd reflection in the glasses. The deep shadow would have been better utilized if there was more fade instead of a sharp division.', '2009-04-08 18:32:33.000000', NULL, 1),
