(5427415, 780276, 101256, '<td valign="top">A good candid utilizing the theme of spontaneity which is unforced and unplanned. Shows a willingness to keep fit. Good detail and pleasant smiles work well. Not a perfect reflection on the challenge theme, but a good solid effort.</td>', 'A good candid utilizing the theme of spontaneity which is unforced and unplanned. Shows a willingness to keep fit. Good detail and pleasant smiles work well. Not a perfect reflection on the challenge theme, but a good solid effort.', '2009-04-08 18:37:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5427417, 780487, 103032, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.  Conveys fitness. Good image.</td>', 'Nice composition.  Conveys fitness. Good image.', '2009-04-08 18:39:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5427418, 780499, 101256, '<td valign="top">Good impact visually, the image appears to be ever so slightly over sharpened as evidenced by the halo around the edges of the subject. It would have helped the image if the subject punching was in shadow which would bring out the lovely complextion and instill a sense of immediacy to the image.  A good effort demonstrating one aspect of fitness and of self defense.</td>', 'Good impact visually, the image appears to be ever so slightly over sharpened as evidenced by the halo around the edges of the subject. It would have helped the image if the subject punching was in shadow which would bring out the lovely complextion and instill a sense of immediacy to the image.  A good effort demonstrating one aspect of fitness and of self defense.', '2009-04-08 18:40:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5427420, 779621, 103032, '<td valign="top">Lenbabies? I like it. Her face is in focus, conveys a lot of movement/action. She looks like she''s having fun...</td>', 'Lenbabies? I like it. Her face is in focus, conveys a lot of movement/action. She looks like she''s having fun...', '2009-04-08 18:41:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5427422, 779958, 101256, '<td valign="top">A definitive action shot demonstrating fitness and activity for kids. The concentration of the subjects face conveys a sense of intensity and purpose. A good image for a motivational poster with many possible meanings. Very well done - it matches the theme in many ways.</td>', 'A definitive action shot demonstrating fitness and activity for kids. The concentration of the subjects face conveys a sense of intensity and purpose. A good image for a motivational poster with many possible meanings. Very well done - it matches the theme in many ways.', '2009-04-08 18:42:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5427428, 780014, 103032, '<td valign="top">Looks technically well done...   Has the gear for fitness... The drawback for me is that it''s static.  But still a good image</td>', 'Looks technically well done...   Has the gear for fitness... The drawback for me is that it''s static.  But still a good image', '2009-04-08 18:45:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5427430, 780130, 101256, '<td valign="top">Crisp and sharp imparts a sense of healthy exercise, purpose and style. A solid image. Perhaps a better background would have enhanced the overall effect, but the flat white works as well. Good color control with no blooming. A nice effort to convey the subject matter of the challenge - fitness.</td>', 'Crisp and sharp imparts a sense of healthy exercise, purpose and style. A solid image. Perhaps a better background would have enhanced the overall effect, but the flat white works as well. Good color control with no blooming. A nice effort to convey the subject matter of the challenge - fitness.', '2009-04-08 18:46:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5427432, 780549, 103032, '<td valign="top">Nice promotion shot for motocross.</td>', 'Nice promotion shot for motocross.', '2009-04-08 18:49:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5427433, 780514, 101256, '<td valign="top">By comparison to an earlier image, the author used the natural shape of the background to form and compliment the model''s posture and presentation. The sharp angles of the background perfectly match the model. The only way to improve this image would be to have the model face the camera using the same posture. Image conveys the meme of yoga as a positive life style - strength, grace. Well done.</td>', 'By comparison to an earlier image, the author used the natural shape of the background to form and compliment the model''s posture and presentation. The sharp angles of the background perfectly match the model. The only way to improve this image would be to have the model face the camera using the same posture. Image conveys the meme of yoga as a positive life style - strength, grace. Well done.', '2009-04-08 18:50:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5427434, 780014, 101256, '<td valign="top">The lighting compliments the sense of durability and health that soccer players have to have to compete. Crisp and sharp image and excellant lighting control. The gentle fade of the goal cage only enhances the image. Well done.</td>', 'The lighting compliments the sense of durability and health that soccer players have to have to compete. Crisp and sharp image and excellant lighting control. The gentle fade of the goal cage only enhances the image. Well done.', '2009-04-08 18:50:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5427435, 780390, 101256, '<td valign="top">An excellant image of the unbridled job of being a child. Soccer at this age level could fairly be called "everybody chase the ball" and this image demonstrates that perfectly.  And excellant capture that captures the nature of youth fitness and the free spirited job of just having fun.  A top ten image and most certainly a ribbon winner.</td>', 'An excellant image of the unbridled job of being a child. Soccer at this age level could fairly be called "everybody chase the ball" and this image demonstrates that perfectly.  And excellant capture that captures the nature of youth fitness and the free spirited job of just having fun.  A top ten image and most certainly a ribbon winner.', '2009-04-08 18:50:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5427436, 780069, 101256, '<td valign="top">Simply a terric image aptly titled imparting a sense of not only strength but of grace and style. The model imparts a sense of confidence and knowledge of her quiet energy. A little minor complaint about the shadow on the model''s right arm, but that''s extremely picky and does not negatively impact the image. A top five image and clearly worthy of a blue ribbon. Well done.</td>', 'Simply a terric image aptly titled imparting a sense of not only strength but of grace and style. The model imparts a sense of confidence and knowledge of her quiet energy. A little minor complaint about the shadow on the model''s right arm, but that''s extremely picky and does not negatively impact the image. A top five image and clearly worthy of a blue ribbon. Well done.', '2009-04-08 18:50:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5427437, 780086, 101256, '<td valign="top">Perfectly framed and composed - a very different presentation on the subject of fitness. The outstanding quality of this image should make it a ribbon contender.</td>', 'Perfectly framed and composed - a very different presentation on the subject of fitness. The outstanding quality of this image should make it a ribbon contender.', '2009-04-08 18:50:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5427438, 780309, 101256, '<td valign="top">Simply perfect - incredible detail and very representative of fitness as a subject challenge. Easily a top ten image and a potential ribbon contender.</td>', 'Simply perfect - incredible detail and very representative of fitness as a subject challenge. Easily a top ten image and a potential ribbon contender.', '2009-04-08 18:50:51.000000', NULL, 1),
