(5427440, 780373, 101256, '<td valign="top">A terrific staged image - strong, purposeful and conveys a sense of the fitness life style.  Well done.</td>', 'A terrific staged image - strong, purposeful and conveys a sense of the fitness life style.  Well done.', '2009-04-08 18:50:59.000000', NULL, 1),
