(5428706, 779885, 99506, '<td valign="top">Nice the way you managed to freeze Jensen here but it isn''t really saying fitness or stock to me.<br/>I think a title like "Fit for purpose" would have worked better but just muy opinion.</td>', 'Nice the way you managed to freeze Jensen here but it isn''t really saying fitness or stock to me.I think a title like "Fit for purpose" would have worked better but just muy opinion.', '2009-04-09 08:01:37.000000', NULL, 1),
