(5428713, 780146, 99506, '<td valign="top">Very nice stock image. I was going to nitpick yoour title saying that this looks like an ice hockey goalie and not a Lacrosse goalie but further investigation revrealed that in 1994 ice hockey was recognized that Canada''s national winter sport. I was only messing though lol. This is a great shot with nice contrast and good focus.</td>', 'Very nice stock image. I was going to nitpick yoour title saying that this looks like an ice hockey goalie and not a Lacrosse goalie but further investigation revrealed that in 1994 ice hockey was recognized that Canada''s national winter sport. I was only messing though lol. This is a great shot with nice contrast and good focus.', '2009-04-09 08:09:05.000000', NULL, 1),
