(5436724, 779748, 80104, '<td valign="top">Boy, I can''t do one of those.  Nice perspective.  Background works well as well as the lighting.  Too bad you don''t have eye contact in this shot.</td>', 'Boy, I can''t do one of those.  Nice perspective.  Background works well as well as the lighting.  Too bad you don''t have eye contact in this shot.', '2009-04-14 13:45:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436728, 779724, 80104, '<td valign="top">A very different shot from most in this challenge.  Colors work but I don''t really like the shape of your photo.  Wished it was in landscape versus portrait</td>', 'A very different shot from most in this challenge.  Colors work but I don''t really like the shape of your photo.  Wished it was in landscape versus portrait', '2009-04-14 13:46:35.000000', NULL, 1),
