(5436732, 778924, 80104, '<td valign="top">This image just doesn''t stick out to me.  It is very natural however but there''s nothing that really appeals to me in the shot.  Maybe a bit of sharpening would have helped and a bit of brightening up?</td>', 'This image just doesn''t stick out to me.  It is very natural however but there''s nothing that really appeals to me in the shot.  Maybe a bit of sharpening would have helped and a bit of brightening up?', '2009-04-14 13:47:46.000000', NULL, 1),
