(5436735, 780490, 80104, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot.  While not eye catching, technically it looks good.  The border definetely helps the shot.</td>', 'Interesting shot.  While not eye catching, technically it looks good.  The border definetely helps the shot.', '2009-04-14 13:48:51.000000', NULL, 1),
