(5436738, 780487, 80104, '<td valign="top">Wish the colors weren''t so blah in this shot.  Your subject really doesn''t stand out as much as I''d like.</td>', 'Wish the colors weren''t so blah in this shot.  Your subject really doesn''t stand out as much as I''d like.', '2009-04-14 13:49:28.000000', NULL, 1),
