(5436741, 780049, 80104, '<td valign="top">This ould have been a great shot if the subjects were facing you and the shutter speed was up a bit to stop from getting bluriness.  A bit of sharpening would have helped here as well.</td>', 'This ould have been a great shot if the subjects were facing you and the shutter speed was up a bit to stop from getting bluriness.  A bit of sharpening would have helped here as well.', '2009-04-14 13:50:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436743, 779679, 80104, '<td valign="top">The lighting you''ve chosen is interesting.  And while not very interesting to me it shows that you have a good grasp of lighting control.  I just wish the face had a tad bit more lighting on it.</td>', 'The lighting you''ve chosen is interesting.  And while not very interesting to me it shows that you have a good grasp of lighting control.  I just wish the face had a tad bit more lighting on it.', '2009-04-14 13:51:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436752, 780549, 80104, '<td valign="top">This shot could have used some adjustments.  While it is a great capture, in terms of image quality it could use improvements.  The background trees seem to take away from the shot.  Maybe if you had shot from a bit lower perspective to get just the sky.  Also because of the lack of lighting on the subject, you''re getting shadow in this shot.  It''s not a silouhette but it''s also not very bright which takes away from your subject''s definition.  Maybe a bit more contrast could help this shot as well.</td>', 'This shot could have used some adjustments.  While it is a great capture, in terms of image quality it could use improvements.  The background trees seem to take away from the shot.  Maybe if you had shot from a bit lower perspective to get just the sky.  Also because of the lack of lighting on the subject, you''re getting shadow in this shot.  It''s not a silouhette but it''s also not very bright which takes away from your subject''s definition.  Maybe a bit more contrast could help this shot as well.', '2009-04-14 13:57:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5436756, 778855, 80104, '<td valign="top">This shot does not appeal to me.  Although one positive is the black background on the shot.</td>', 'This shot does not appeal to me.  Although one positive is the black background on the shot.', '2009-04-14 13:57:35.000000', NULL, 1),
