(5439182, 780497, 95687, '<td valign="top">anyone who tells you an image isn''t "stock" hasn''t sold stock photography.  ANYTHING sells - I think this is a great shot - would love to see a new ball, but it would still sell.  I''m amazed at what sells - I send it ALL in, whether I think it''s stock or not.<br/> <br/>This is very nice work.</td>', 'anyone who tells you an image isn''t "stock" hasn''t sold stock photography.  ANYTHING sells - I think this is a great shot - would love to see a new ball, but it would still sell.  I''m amazed at what sells - I send it ALL in, whether I think it''s stock or not. This is very nice work.', '2009-04-15 16:21:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(5439184, 779679, 95687, '<td valign="top">the fact that an image this strong is down here at 15 shows that you should put no stock in DPC feedback - ever!  This is great work.</td>', 'the fact that an image this strong is down here at 15 shows that you should put no stock in DPC feedback - ever!  This is great work.', '2009-04-15 16:23:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(5439187, 780014, 95687, '<td valign="top">People, in general, have no concept of what a stock photo is.  I thought I knew, then I started selling them, now I''m SURE I don''t know.  I''ve had the dumbest stuff sell for hundreds of dollars a shot.<br/> <br/>This is great work - it IS a stock shot because it came out of a camera.  :-)</td>', 'People, in general, have no concept of what a stock photo is.  I thought I knew, then I started selling them, now I''m SURE I don''t know.  I''ve had the dumbest stuff sell for hundreds of dollars a shot. This is great work - it IS a stock shot because it came out of a camera.  :-)', '2009-04-15 16:25:30.000000', NULL, 0),
