(5439897, 779061, 101678, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Connor:</b></div><hr/><i> wow, i realy like the look on his eyes, and where did you get a pilots uniform, lol, this has to make top 10   8 </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Ha! Thanks Connor.  You actually have to be a pilot to have the uniform, which I don''t recommend.  The job sure isn''t what it used to be.  Technically this shot is poo, and the scores definitely show it.  It was an idea I had and I literally had 45 minutes to execute before I left on a 5 day trip right during the challenge submission time.  It was either shoot it and submit, substandard as it is, or just skip it.  I probably should have skipped it.  :)<br/> <br/>Thanks for the nice comment though.  I appreciate it.</td>', 'Originally posted by Connor: wow, i realy like the look on his eyes, and where did you get a pilots uniform, lol, this has to make top 10   8   Ha! Thanks Connor.  You actually have to be a pilot to have the uniform, which I don''t recommend.  The job sure isn''t what it used to be.  Technically this shot is poo, and the scores definitely show it.  It was an idea I had and I literally had 45 minutes to execute before I left on a 5 day trip right during the challenge submission time.  It was either shoot it and submit, substandard as it is, or just skip it.  I probably should have skipped it.  :) Thanks for the nice comment though.  I appreciate it.', '2009-04-16 03:10:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(5439916, 780373, 63716, '<td valign="top">You need to tell us what challenges you''re entering so we know not to bother (-:<br/> <br/>Seriously though - the new lights are working well... and you just can''t go past that 85mm - I think that one is super-glued to the front of your camera!</td>', 'You need to tell us what challenges you''re entering so we know not to bother (-: Seriously though - the new lights are working well... and you just can''t go past that 85mm - I think that one is super-glued to the front of your camera!', '2009-04-16 03:55:41.000000', NULL, 0),
